Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 22:51:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Add Insurance Brokers industry and per-section working
 paper filing

- Add "Insurance Brokers" as its own industry option (distinct from
  "Insurance"/underwriters), with its own suggested substantive
  procedures covering client/premium trust accounts, brokerage
  commission income, and amounts due to/from insurers.
- Substantive Procedures: each audit area section can now have working
  papers filed directly under it (new Document.substantive_area_id
  link), with its own upload form and file list in that section, in
  addition to the engagement's general Documents tab. Deleting one of
  these now returns to the Substantive Procedures tab instead of
  Documents.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Dq9HgqbdeP7FfLVNZ4DSAc
